{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two fixes on branch cursor/photo-fixes. No DB migrations, no paid services.\n\n1) Share origin. src/lib/kisses/server.ts getShareOrigin (~lines 1092-1106) prefers env VITE_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME (currently kiss-pied.vercel.app, which 308-redirects to app.sendkiss.online, so WhatsApp gets a redirect and falls back to the generic card). Change: when process.env.VERCEL_ENV exists and is not \"production\", ignore VITE_PUBLIC_HOSTNAME and use the request host (so previews point at themselves). In production, if the configured hostname is kiss-pied.vercel.app (or any *.vercel.app), use https://app.sendkiss.online instead, so no redirect happens even before the env is changed. Keep it one small helper used by src/routes/k.$from.tsx (og:url/og:image ~lines 16, 31-32, 41-47). Leave scripts/grok-pwa-shared.mjs logic alone except if it uses the same hostname for og tags, apply the same helper/normalization there minimally.\n\n2) Card size. src/routes/c.$code.ts (~22-27) serves getShareCard (server.ts ~1108-1137) as-is; when no stored card exists (e.g. QR path) it falls back to the 512x512 profile photo, while k.$from.tsx hardcodes og:image 1200x630. Fix: when no stored card, render a 1200x630 JPEG on the server from the profile photo, matching the look of the browser card in src/lib/kiss-card.ts (lines ~10-11: dark/brand background, face in a circle, the \"COME GET IT\" style text). Use `sharp` (compose background + circular-masked photo; text via an SVG overlay) — make sure it works on Vercel Node runtime; add the dependency properly. Cache the result (e.g. write it into share_cards is NOT allowed if it needs a schema change — only use existing tables/columns; if caching needs a write to an existing table/column that's fine, otherwise rely on HTTP cache headers). If a stored card exists but is not 1200x630, also pass it through the same normalization. Also generate/store the card on the QR path the same way the send-sheet does if trivial. Result: /c/<code> always returns 1200x630 image/jpeg, consistent with the meta.\n\nRun typecheck and vite build. Add a script test or quick check if the repo has a test pattern. Commit \"Invite preview: canonical origin + always 1200x630 card\" and push.\n\nRules for this run: add exactly ONE new commit on cursor/photo-fixes and push it (PR #14 updates itself). Do NOT merge, deploy, change Vercel env vars, or write to any real database (do not run npm run build, it runs db:migrate; use vite build with DATABASE_URL unset; for local server tests use the in-memory PGLite with DATABASE_URL empty, on a free port other than 8080). Do not commit docs/AGENT-PROMPT-PHOTOS*.txt, logs, android/ or ios/."}]},"session_id":"5d8046c4-f2b3-4249-9034-da1b847ddf76"}
